9
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:53,280
Triumph for our heroes,

10
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:55,280
safe return for all!

11
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,789
Triumph for our heroes...

12
00:01:56,789 --> 00:01:57,950
On the battlefield,

13
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,039
weapons are blind

14
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:00,120
and perils abound.

15
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,040
Are you really willing to
leave your family

16
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,240
and business behind?

17
00:02:07,070 --> 00:02:07,870
Family?

18
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:10,800
What family?

19
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,070
But as for you, Ms. Ye,

20
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,010
have you really given up

21
00:02:19,190 --> 00:02:20,320
on studying abroad?

22
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,190
It's my honor to defend my country.

23
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,000
Besides,

24
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,820
if Qingyu were still here,

25
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:32,090
he'd have made the same choice.

26
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:39,960
Triumph for our heroes,

27
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:41,750
safe return for all!

28
