Triumph for our heroes,

33
00:02:51,410 --> 00:02:53,000
safe return for all!

34
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:21,360
Stop!

35
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:29,270
[Answering the call to arms
to defend our homeland]

36
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,560
He can finally let go of the past

37
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,800
and start a new life.

38
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:40,950
Isn't this exactly what I want to see?

39
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:43,720
He hates me so much now.

40
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,680
Telling him about this

41
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,250
would just be asking for humiliation.

42
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:53,000
Even if the road ahead is tough,

43
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,159
I will raise our child well on my own.

44
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,159
Miss Ren,

45
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:55,000
where are you going?

46
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:59,300
Inspector Li, you think too highly of me.

47
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,170
In my current state,

48
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:03,010
where else can I go?

49
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,080
Then get in

50
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,030
and return

51
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:06,520
to the hospital with me.

52
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,560
We walk different paths.

53
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,040
Why are you in my business?

54
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:10,920
Then should I

55
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,680
just let you murder my father?

56
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,120
You're a filial son, huh?

57
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,000
But if you shield a criminal,

58
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,950
you can kiss your

59
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,740
police badge goodbye.

60
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,260
I will get to the bottom

61
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,830
of the North-South Railway case.

62
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,390
But before that,

63
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:32,510
I'll never let you hurt the innocent.

64
00:06:36,070 --> 00:06:36,870
The innocent?

65
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:38,870
Who's innocent?

66
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:40,230
Li Rongzhang?

67
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,060
You investigating

68
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,200
and I seeking revenge are

69
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,180
both just ways to validate our own paths.

70
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:53,080
May the best man win.

71
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:55,840
The batch of arms
on the Fang family's ship

72
00:06:55,950 --> 00:06:57,750
did belong to my father's army.

73
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,300
Are you admitting that

74
00:07:04,390 --> 00:07:05,720
Li Rongzhang killed my father?

75
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,650
On the contrary.

76
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:09,390
The transactions between
my father and Master Fang had been

77
00:07:09,390 --> 00:07:10,520
going on for 5 years.

78
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:14,360
They always used the guise
of transporting military medical supplies

79
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,220
to transport arms and gunpowder.

80
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,620
And about this matter,

81
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,330
Master Fang was well aware.

82
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,560
So it's completely untrue

83
00:07:21,830 --> 00:07:23,600
that my father smuggled arms

84
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:26,310
and caused the ship to explode.

85
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:28,070
Are you trying to say

86
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,330
that the explosion

87
00:07:31,190 --> 00:07:32,430
was an accident?

88
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:41,750
[Marine Logbook of the Remote Star]

89
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:46,000
The ship Master Fang was on,
the Remote Star,

90
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,040
made countless round trips
between Nancheng and Nanyang.

91
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,560
Every time it left the port,

92
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:53,020
there were safety officers
to make a record.

93
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:55,650
You can check out
the previous draft levels.

94
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:58,880
[Ship Logbook]

95
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,680
Only the draft of the last departure was

96
00:08:03,950 --> 00:08:05,120
deeper than before.

97
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,630
You mean the ship

98
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,430
carried things other than arms,

99
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:15,290
[Ship Logbook]

100
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:15,090
but there's no record of it?

101
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,120
So what exactly

102
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,070
was added to the ship,

103
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,690
and who did it belong to?

104
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,000
How is it

105
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,940
related to Master Fang

106
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,570
leaving your wedding
to rush back to Nanyang?

107
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:33,909
And what role did it play
in that explosion?

108
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:35,520
Aren't you curious?

109
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,120
What are you getting at?

110
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:41,030
Ren Susu,

111
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,320
face reality.

112
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,080
The Fangs have fallen,

113
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:49,230
and the Murongs won't acknowledge you.

114
00:08:49,910 --> 00:08:51,030
As a mere orphan,

115
00:08:51,510 --> 00:08:53,120
be it to seek revenge

116
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,970
or investigate the matter,

117
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,660
you have to risk your life.

118
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:59,070
But can you afford to risk your life now?

119
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,520
Don't you care

120
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,480
about your child?

121
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:09,120
Qingyi is my family,

122
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,630
so I will take good care of his child.

123
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,270
And my father is

124
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:17,650
even more so my family.

125
00:09:18,550 --> 00:09:20,270
So I will clear his name.

126
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:26,510
Why do you need to prove

127
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:27,510
to a nobody like me

128
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,550
that the Lis are innocent?

129
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:33,930
Aren't you afraid that the end result...

130
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,960
If it really has to do with my father,

131
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:40,510
then regardless of
new grudges or old debts,

132
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:42,790
I swear by the police badge on my cap

133
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:45,670
that I'll bring
the real culprit to justice

134
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:47,800
and get justice for the innocent dead.

135
00:10:05,670 --> 00:10:06,400
Stop the car.

136
00:10:06,790 --> 00:10:07,600
See her out.

137
00:10:22,150 --> 00:10:22,840
Qingyu,

138
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,750
don't worry.

139
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:29,040
I'll protect everyone
in both of our families.

140
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,520
Everything here...

141
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,280
will remain the same.

142
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:05,310
♪ The more passionate ♪

143
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:07,310
♪ Our past embrace ♪

144
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:10,320
Those days 3 years ago

145
00:11:10,030 --> 00:11:11,800
♪ The more icy ♪

146
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,780
were actually very short.

147
00:11:11,930 --> 00:11:13,890
♪ Our present clash ♪

148
00:11:12,790 --> 00:11:13,510
Qingyi,

149
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:15,810
you should hate me.

150
00:11:15,910 --> 00:11:18,330
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

151
00:11:18,870 --> 00:11:21,740
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

152
00:11:22,470 --> 00:11:27,420
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

153
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:27,720
If one day

154
00:11:28,390 --> 00:11:29,720
I can no longer love you,

155
00:11:30,010 --> 00:11:31,900
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

156
00:11:30,870 --> 00:11:32,150
the only thing that'll keep me alive

157
00:11:31,970 --> 00:11:34,500
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

158
00:11:32,510 --> 00:11:33,790
is my hatred for you.

159
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:36,750
So,

160
00:11:36,450 --> 00:11:38,330
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

161
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,960
I'd rather time freeze at this second.

162
00:11:38,350 --> 00:11:40,490
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

163
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,240
♪ Let the ropes of fate ♪

164
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:48,000
♪ Bind you and me ♪

165
00:11:49,230 --> 00:11:51,700
♪ Even if led to a precipice ♪

166
00:11:51,710 --> 00:11:54,110
♪ Together, we fall ♪

167
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:55,980
We won! We won!

168
00:11:56,010 --> 00:11:58,490
We won! We won!

169
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,170
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

170
00:11:58,220 --> 00:12:00,100
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

171
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:01,030
We won! We won!

172
00:12:00,670 --> 00:12:02,930
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

173
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:01,790
Principal,

174
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,080
we won!

175
00:12:02,950 --> 00:12:04,590
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

176
00:12:03,390 --> 00:12:05,720
We won! We won!

177
00:12:04,610 --> 00:12:06,690
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

178
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:10,000
We won! We won!

179
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:09,600
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

180
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:12,870
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

181
00:12:10,150 --> 00:12:12,510
We won! We won!

182
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:15,630
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

183
00:12:16,370 --> 00:12:19,450
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

184
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,130
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

185
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,160
♪ We ♪

186
00:12:24,190 --> 00:12:26,290
♪ Must be together ♪

187
00:12:27,090 --> 00:12:29,990
♪ Forevermore ♪

188
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:39,750
Le'an.

189
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,910
It's snowing!

190
00:12:42,550 --> 00:12:43,360
Le'an.

191
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,640
Where are you running to?

192
00:12:46,750 --> 00:12:48,670
Mom, it's snowing.

193
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:49,670
It's too cold.

194
00:12:49,790 --> 00:12:50,250
Come on,

195
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,480
I'll take you back inside.

196
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,030
I want to play in the snow.

197
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:04,000
[Upholding his elder brother's unfulfilled
legacy and heeding the nation's call,]

198
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,100
[Murong Qingyi led aviation students to the
southwestern front, to serve the country.]

199
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,150
[Through the arduous, perilous journey,
he achieved great feats with patriotic zeal.]

200
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:06,940
[The fires of war raged for 6 long years;
6 years since he left his homeland.]

201
00:13:06,950 --> 00:13:11,470
[Congratulations on the full opening
of the North-South Railway]

202
00:13:16,470 --> 00:13:21,350
[Nancheng Station]

203
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:18,000
Bravo! Bravo!

204
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,000
Marshal Li,

205
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,790
the North-South Railway
is officially open.

206
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:27,200
As the person in charge,

207
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,460
care to say a few words?

208
00:13:30,030 --> 00:13:31,760
After a turbulent few decades,

209
00:13:32,750 --> 00:13:34,000
the North-South Railway

210
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,440
is finally fully operational.

211
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:37,390
I shoulder a heavy responsibility.

212
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:39,030
I promise to use this railway

213
00:13:39,790 --> 00:13:41,050
to benefit the people.

214
00:13:41,790 --> 00:13:43,750
Bravo! Bravo!

215
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:45,960
Mr. Zhang!

216
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,910
The Zhang family has invested heavily
in this railway construction.

217
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:49,670
Regarding this,

218
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:51,730
what are your future business plans?

219
00:13:51,730 --> 00:13:57,260
[Nancheng Station]

220
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:53,920
It's an honor for the Zhangs

221
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:55,690
to cooperate with Marshal Li.

222
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:56,920
In the future,

223
00:13:57,030 --> 00:13:58,080
this railway will

224
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:01,030
also be the main transport artery
for our pharmaceutical factory.

225
00:14:01,030 --> 00:14:03,760
We'll supply
high-quality, low-cost medicines

226
00:14:03,960 --> 00:14:05,690
to the public and the military.

227
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:08,600
Bravo! Bravo!

228
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:11,790
-Bravo!
-Great!

229
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,320
Bravo!

230
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,250
Gentlemen, please look over here.

231
00:14:20,390 --> 00:14:21,150
Marshal Li.

232
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:26,790
Foreigner's dog piss...

233
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:28,680
No thanks.

234
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:39,240
The landscape of Nancheng

235
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:41,630
has changed drastically in 7 years.

236
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,320
Now that the Murongs are weakened,

237
00:14:45,030 --> 00:14:47,090
you've become the real shot-caller.

238
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,550
Our Zhang family also

239
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,200
feels deeply honored.

240
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,680
Are you dropping hints at me?

241
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:56,550
No.

242
00:14:59,030 --> 00:14:59,550
Yes,

243
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:02,720
your family
has contributed money and effort.

244
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,320
But you must get one thing straight:

245
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,080
With or without your family,

246
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,440
I'm still the one calling the shots

247
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:12,310
about the North-South Railway.

248
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:13,600
Naturally.

249
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:16,350
I have no intention of claiming credit.

250
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:19,560
I'm just here to propose a deal
on behalf of my father.

251
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:24,440
As long as

252
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,240
you open the door of convenience

253
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,550
for us on the railway,

254
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:30,350
the medicines we produce will be

255
00:15:30,550 --> 00:15:32,360
supplied to the military first.

256
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:35,750
And of all pharmaceutical sales...

257
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,570
you'll get a 10% cut.

258
00:15:56,300 --> 00:16:00,520
[Lanxin Theater]

259
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:21,360
Susu,

260
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:22,280
you're here.

261
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:25,230
What did you find out?

262
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,840
On this trip back to Nanyang,

263
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:30,440
I finally found the Fangs' old butler,
Mr. Bao.

264
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:32,510
When Uncle Fang's ship sank,

265
00:16:32,790 --> 00:16:34,250
he was supposed to be on it.

266
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,960
He told me...

267
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:42,440
These are all arms.

268
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,870
Lash them down for the rough seas.

269
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:44,600
Look at this!

270
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,380
Lash it down tight.

271
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,480
The German arms bought by Li Rongzhang
over the years

272
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,870
were basically transported by the Fangs

273
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:54,600
via sea routes to Nancheng.

274
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:57,570
Nothing ever went wrong with this before.

275
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,150
But that one time,

276
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:01,440
a sailor found something

277
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:04,530
that had never been there before
under the arms.

278
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,880
Some sailors

279
00:17:17,069 --> 00:17:18,530
secretly took those pills

280
00:17:18,589 --> 00:17:20,520
and started behaving abnormally,

281
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:21,790
while others became lethargic.

282
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:23,050
What are you two doing?

283
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,420
What's wrong with you?

284
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:33,640
How dare you smoke opium?

285
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:36,700
If Master finds out, you'll all be fired!

286
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:37,790
Mr. Bao,

287
00:17:38,510 --> 00:17:39,830
th-this isn't opium.

288
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,110
I-It's medicine.

289
00:17:42,030 --> 00:17:42,630
Medicine?

290
00:17:45,110 --> 00:17:46,570
According to the sailors,

291
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:47,960
this medicine is

292
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,690
extremely popular in Nanyang,

293
00:17:49,750 --> 00:17:51,150
as it boosts your energy.

294
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:53,410
So, Mr. Bao let his guard down.

295
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:57,550
He didn't want to offend the Lis
over his sailors stealing the medicine,

296
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:59,150
so he suppressed the matter.

297
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:04,160
But, a few days later,

298
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:06,720
the sailors who took the medicine
started getting sick—

299
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,980
high fevers and rashes

300
00:18:08,070 --> 00:18:09,730
that even seemed contagious.

301
00:18:11,270 --> 00:18:12,000
Come!

302
00:18:13,790 --> 00:18:14,790
So, Mr. Bao sent a telegram

303
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:16,720
to Uncle Fang to handle it quickly.

304
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,000
Uncle Fang replied and warned him

305
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,880
not to let anyone
leave the ship and go ashore,

306
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:22,340
lest there be an accident.

307
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:28,070
Mr. Bao was both afraid of
catching the strange disease

308
00:18:28,070 --> 00:18:29,920
and of being punished by Uncle Fang,

309
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:32,250
so he secretly went ashore
in a small boat.

310
00:18:32,310 --> 00:18:32,970
As a result,

311
00:18:33,270 --> 00:18:34,730
he escaped the explosion.

312
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:40,160
What were the pills

313
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,700
on the ship called?

314
00:18:43,400 --> 00:18:44,830
The sailors called them

315
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,680
Red Pills.

316
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,640
Red Pills?

317
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,070
Isn't that a drug?

318
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:54,860
They weren't ordinary Red Pills.

319
00:18:56,550 --> 00:18:57,350
With Mr. Bao as a witness

320
00:18:57,350 --> 00:18:58,440
and the Red Pills as evidence,

321
00:18:58,440 --> 00:18:59,160
we can kill

322
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:00,400
that old bastard Li!

323
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:02,040
Li Rongzhang can't die yet.

324
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,160
Why?

325
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:05,110
If Li Rongzhang is

326
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,680
really a link in this drug chain,

327
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:07,350
killing him

328
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,030
will cut off our trail.

329
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:11,070
To eradicate the Red Pills,

330
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:12,350
we must follow the trail

331
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:13,240
and find the source.

332
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:16,170
I only heard of Red Pills
appearing in coastal areas,

333
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,530
but they actually spread to Nancheng.

334
00:19:18,550 --> 00:19:19,880
This is no small matter.

335
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,000
No matter how serious,

336
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,000
it's for the authorities to handle.

337
00:19:23,830 --> 00:19:24,640
The Red Pill

338
00:19:25,030 --> 00:19:26,310
not only physically

339
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,220
destroys the addicts,

340
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:31,380
but also has absolute control
over their minds.

341
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,070
If we let it spread,

342
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:35,880
sooner or later,
there will be no more usable soldiers.

343
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:36,680
So,

344
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:38,790
you don't want revenge anymore?

345
00:19:38,790 --> 00:19:39,750
Of course I want revenge.

346
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:40,750
-How long?
-Just…

347
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,450
A year, 2 years, or 10 years?

348
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,150
Every day the Red Pill matter
remains unsolved

349
00:19:44,150 --> 00:19:45,480
is a day Li Rongzhang retains power!

350
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:46,640
How's that justified?

351
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,640
In today's

352
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:48,920
dog-eat-dog world,

353
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:50,590
truth and justice are but myths!

354
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:51,640
Don't forget what

355
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:54,000
we've been planning for all these years.

356
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:54,880
Ren Susu,

357
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:56,200
you can wait,

358
00:19:57,270 --> 00:19:58,270
but I can't.

359
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,030
All these years,

360
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:04,480
my brother has appeared
in my dreams every night,

361
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,880
charred all over,

362
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,160
covered in blood,

363
00:20:07,550 --> 00:20:09,280
crying out for me to avenge him.

364
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:14,240
Qing!

365
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:15,960
I won't persuade you,

366
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,690
so don't you try to persuade me.

367
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:19,550
I'll avenge

368
00:20:20,030 --> 00:20:21,290
my brother and Mr. Fang

369
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:23,310
myself.

370
00:20:42,630 --> 00:20:45,610
[Xanadu Cabaret]

371
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:43,830
Your hairpin.

372
00:21:46,510 --> 00:21:47,510
Thank you, sir.

373
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:58,030
Who sent you?

374
00:21:58,750 --> 00:21:59,480
No one.

375
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:02,440
Li Rongzhang, you have
so much blood on your hands.

376
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,700
I'm your retribution!

377
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:07,240
Retribution?

378
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:10,480
I'd like to see

379
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:13,110
if I'm afraid of retribution

380
00:22:13,110 --> 00:22:14,970
or if retribution's afraid of me.

381
00:22:18,510 --> 00:22:20,510
This retribution is quite a beauty.

382
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:23,210
Get lost.

383
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:24,590
Marshal,

384
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:27,640
we should take her back for interrogation.

385
00:22:29,350 --> 00:22:30,960
Many people want me dead.

386
00:22:31,830 --> 00:22:33,690
I have no interest in knowing why.

387
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:34,720
Li Rongzhang!

388
00:22:35,310 --> 00:22:36,770
If you don't kill me today,

389
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,030
you'll regret it!

390
00:22:40,030 --> 00:22:41,070
You should be glad

391
00:22:41,720 --> 00:22:43,520
that I like the look of you today.

392
00:22:44,830 --> 00:22:46,000
Want to kill me?

393
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:48,070
Oh, kid...

394
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:20,570
Why are you here?

395
00:23:25,830 --> 00:23:27,090
What's with that look?

396
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,610
Are you afraid of me?

397
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:34,410
Or do you hate me?

398
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,530
What happened to your hand?

399
00:23:56,740 --> 00:23:59,000
I tried to kill Li Rongzhang and got hurt.

400
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:00,640
It's a pity.

401
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:03,530
That old bastard sure is lucky.

402
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:06,330
I couldn't make him die on the streets.

403
00:24:09,510 --> 00:24:10,160
I knew it.

404
00:24:13,510 --> 00:24:15,640
You and Ren Susu are working together.

405
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:17,720
So you knew all along

406
00:24:18,510 --> 00:24:20,310
that she'd try to assassinate my father

407
00:24:20,310 --> 00:24:21,510
at Qingyu's wedding.

408
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,240
So what if I knew?

409
00:24:23,550 --> 00:24:24,440
Doesn't he deserve to die?

410
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,240
What about me?

411
00:24:27,830 --> 00:24:28,920
What am I to you,

412
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:31,030
exactly?

413
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:34,610
Just a casual fling,

414
00:24:35,510 --> 00:24:36,970
or a premeditated scheme?

415
00:24:38,590 --> 00:24:39,510
Or has there ever been

416
00:24:39,510 --> 00:24:41,770
a part of you
that loved me even a tiny bit?

417
00:24:50,070 --> 00:24:51,600
You are Li Rongzhang's son.

418
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:55,030
What do you think?

419
00:24:58,880 --> 00:24:59,750
I understand.

420
00:25:02,750 --> 00:25:04,280
So from the very beginning,

421
00:25:04,960 --> 00:25:06,160
to you,

422
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,420
I've always been an enemy.

423
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,460
As long as my surname's Li,

424
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:12,310
you'll never trust me.

425
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:15,130
You've never truly

426
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:18,030
shed your mask for me either.

427
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,960
It was all my wishful thinking.

428
00:25:22,590 --> 00:25:23,960
I was delusional.

429
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:35,070
Li Boze!

430
00:25:38,350 --> 00:25:41,480
Can you give up your status
as the young master of the Lis?

431
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,550
Can you?

432
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:46,440
If you can...

433
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:48,000
You can try to kill him as many times

434
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,000
as you want...

435
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:53,640
but I won't let you
lay a finger on my father!

436
00:26:20,310 --> 00:26:20,750
Look!

437
00:26:20,750 --> 00:26:22,110
-There's a plane!
-A plane?

438
00:26:22,110 --> 00:26:23,070
It's a plane!

439
00:26:24,270 --> 00:26:25,550
-It's a plane from the aviation school!
-Really?

440
00:26:25,550 --> 00:26:26,240
Really?

441
00:26:26,510 --> 00:26:28,960
We won at the frontlines! They're back!

442
00:26:41,590 --> 00:26:42,590
They're here!

443
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,110
Young Marshal Murong,

444
00:26:44,110 --> 00:26:44,960
it's been 7 years.

445
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,000
How does it feel to be back?

446
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:47,160
You triumphed in battle.

447
00:26:47,160 --> 00:26:48,790
Care to share your experience?

448
00:26:48,790 --> 00:26:50,200
The North-South Railway is
now owned by the Lis,

449
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,070
and the Murongs are weakened.

450
00:26:51,070 --> 00:26:52,830
-Which side are you on?
-As Zhenhua Aviation School's principal,

451
00:26:52,830 --> 00:26:53,830
how do you feel right now?

452
00:26:53,830 --> 00:26:54,350
Please say something.

453
00:26:54,350 --> 00:26:56,070
The Murongs have produced
two aviation school principals.

454
00:26:56,070 --> 00:26:57,200
Do you have anything to say?

455
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,110
Young Master Qingyi,

456
00:26:58,110 --> 00:26:59,910
why are you back a few days early?

457
00:27:00,030 --> 00:27:01,680
The higher-ups told me to return early

458
00:27:01,680 --> 00:27:03,410
to probe military corruption.

459
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:04,480
Oh, right.

460
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,460
Take a look at this.

461
00:27:06,480 --> 00:27:07,340
Seen it before?

462
00:27:11,070 --> 00:27:11,830
This is...

463
00:27:13,070 --> 00:27:14,400
This is a new type of drug

464
00:27:15,350 --> 00:27:16,750
we found in the military.

465
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,140
Principal,

466
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,920
this was found in the military camp.

467
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:22,650
It's probably made from opium.

468
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:32,960
It has spread its way to Nancheng.

469
00:27:33,550 --> 00:27:34,950
My informant told me that

470
00:27:34,960 --> 00:27:38,640
Li Rongzhang is suspected of
funding his army through corruption.

471
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:40,040
Would Marshal Li do that?

472
00:27:40,480 --> 00:27:42,010
Who cares if he would or not.

473
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:43,240
I came back this time

474
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,510
to resolve this case.

475
00:27:45,110 --> 00:27:45,770
Otherwise,

476
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:47,960
this drug will cause endless harm.

477
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:49,510
Upon learning of your return,

478
00:27:49,510 --> 00:27:52,000
both the Murongs and the Lis
sent word immediately.

479
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,590
The Murongs want you home for dinner,

480
00:27:53,590 --> 00:27:54,720
while Marshal Li has

481
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:56,240
set up a banquet at Lanxin Theater

482
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:57,240
to welcome you.

483
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:59,360
Where should we go first?

484
00:28:01,790 --> 00:28:03,480
For the Red Pill investigation,

485
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:04,480
I can't miss

486
00:28:04,790 --> 00:28:05,790
the Lis' dinner.

487
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,010
Let's go.

488
00:28:16,430 --> 00:28:19,940
[Lanxin Theater]

489
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:22,400
Qiaoqiao,

490
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:23,790
where are you?

491
00:28:41,790 --> 00:28:43,270
Where'd this low-life come from?

492
00:28:43,270 --> 00:28:44,470
Trying to get killed?

493
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:48,380
Apologize.

494
00:28:49,590 --> 00:28:50,200
I'm sorry!

495
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,040
I'm sorry.

496
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:51,930
Get lost.

497
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,640
Thank you, Mister.

498
00:29:03,960 --> 00:29:06,220
It's dangerous to be on the street alone.

499
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:07,920
I...

500
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:13,030
Qiaoqiao ran onto the street.

501
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:15,240
I came out to find it.

502
00:29:20,470 --> 00:29:22,440
Don't do such a dangerous thing again,

503
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,100
you hear me?

504
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:26,590
If Qiaoqiao's in danger again,

505
00:29:26,830 --> 00:29:28,480
I will save it again.

506
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:30,480
Qiaoqiao is my family.

507
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:34,440
Yes,

508
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:35,960
a real man should

509
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:37,600
protect his family well.

510
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:40,830
Mister.

511
00:29:41,240 --> 00:29:42,590
Where's your family?

512
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,350
My family...

513
00:29:49,110 --> 00:29:50,440
went to a faraway place.

514
00:29:53,790 --> 00:29:56,510
My dad went to a faraway place too.

515
00:30:00,530 --> 00:30:01,350
Where's your home?

516
00:30:01,350 --> 00:30:02,410
I'll take you back.

517
00:30:07,440 --> 00:30:08,400
Lanxin Theater.

518
00:30:08,550 --> 00:30:10,310
My mom and I live there.

519
00:30:13,720 --> 00:30:14,250
Let's go.

520
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,340
Come on.

521
00:30:17,710 --> 00:30:23,430
[Lanxin Theater]

522
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:19,840
After you.

523
00:30:21,350 --> 00:30:22,010
To the left.

524
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,030
I heard that

525
00:30:23,030 --> 00:30:24,310
the boss of Lanxin Theater

526
00:30:24,310 --> 00:30:25,920
has a rich patron backing her.

527
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:26,960
More than that;

528
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,480
she even had a child for that patron.

529
00:30:29,590 --> 00:30:30,720
No wonder.

530
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:33,510
There's no way she could've
just opened such a big theater.

531
00:30:33,510 --> 00:30:35,970
-So it's shady business.
-Mister, let's go.

532
00:30:43,110 --> 00:30:43,720
Le'an,

533
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:46,160
if you hear nonsense in the future,

534
00:30:46,160 --> 00:30:47,200
just cover your ears.

535
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,590
Don't listen to it, okay?

536
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:49,920
But if I cover my ears,

537
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:52,270
will they stop talking nonsense?

538
00:30:52,550 --> 00:30:54,110
I still have to face it myself.

539
00:30:54,110 --> 00:30:54,790
Mister,

540
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:56,550
be more mature, okay?

541
00:30:58,400 --> 00:30:59,530
You're so sensible.

542
00:31:00,270 --> 00:31:00,750
Mister,

543
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:01,550
let's go.

544
00:31:08,030 --> 00:31:09,360
Where could he've gone?

545
00:31:09,550 --> 00:31:10,640
Have you searched everywhere?

546
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,270
We've searched every corner
of the theater.

547
00:31:12,270 --> 00:31:14,670
Could Young Master Le'an have run outside?

548
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,400
I'll go outside to look.

549
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:17,000
Boss,

550
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,160
we've found Young Master Le'an.

551
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:20,290
He was brought back by a kind stranger.

552
00:31:21,180 --> 00:31:21,980
That's great.

553
00:31:23,070 --> 00:31:24,000
Reward him properly

554
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:24,790
with more money.

555
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:25,960
But the gentleman said

556
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:28,590
he must deliver the child
to his mother in person.

557
00:31:28,590 --> 00:31:29,400
Where is he?

558
00:31:29,510 --> 00:31:30,510
He's on his way up.

559
00:31:55,550 --> 00:31:56,070
Boss,

560
00:31:56,480 --> 00:31:58,830
this gentleman
brought Young Master Le'an back.

561
00:31:58,830 --> 00:31:59,510
Mom!

562
00:32:01,830 --> 00:32:03,070
You scared me to death.

563
00:32:03,070 --> 00:32:04,030
Sir, the dog.

564
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:05,880
Yes.

565
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:09,550
Yan,

566
00:32:10,110 --> 00:32:11,200
take Le'an to play.

567
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,160
Sir...

568
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:33,170
thank you for bringing Le'an back.

569
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,900
Sorry for the trouble.

570
00:32:37,510 --> 00:32:38,510
No trouble at all.

571
00:32:39,110 --> 00:32:39,880
Le'an is

572
00:32:40,270 --> 00:32:41,030
quite cute.

573
00:32:43,030 --> 00:32:44,310
I'm really sorry.

574
00:32:45,440 --> 00:32:46,110
It's...

575
00:32:47,550 --> 00:32:49,550
It's not convenient for me to go out,

576
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:52,130
so I couldn't thank you in person.

577
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:56,510
You manage such a large business

578
00:32:56,510 --> 00:32:57,910
with all sorts of people.

579
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,970
It's better to be more careful.

580
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:04,400
You're right.

581
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,090
The theater is hectic.

582
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:10,920
I should take better care of Le'an.

583
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:16,770
Since the child's been found,

584
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:17,980
I'll take my leave.

585
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:20,000
Goodbye.

586
00:33:49,510 --> 00:33:50,160
Madam,

587
00:33:51,750 --> 00:33:53,000
is the perfume balm

588
00:33:53,790 --> 00:33:55,000
you're wearing

589
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:57,110
Fruhjahr?

590
00:34:00,060 --> 00:34:04,560
♪ In those fleeting
three seconds of twilight ♪

591
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:10,219
♪ An amber dream shimmers
within the glass ♪

592
00:34:06,790 --> 00:34:07,350
Yes.

593
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:09,760
What about it?

594
00:34:12,429 --> 00:34:16,870
♪ The ice of loneliness
melts away in the warmth ♪

595
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:16,960
Nothing.

596
00:34:18,750 --> 00:34:22,320
♪ Your evasive gaze
gives your heart away ♪

597
00:34:19,510 --> 00:34:21,440
It just reminds me of an old friend.

598
00:34:22,840 --> 00:34:24,570
She loved to use this brand too.

599
00:34:24,860 --> 00:34:28,730
♪ Don't tell me ♪

600
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:29,320
It seems...

601
00:34:29,409 --> 00:34:33,719
♪ You're tired again; this time, don't ♪

602
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:33,530
you miss this friend very much.

603
00:34:35,429 --> 00:34:38,040
♪ Don't push me away
only to draw me close ♪

604
00:34:37,510 --> 00:34:38,550
Miss her?

605
00:34:38,060 --> 00:34:39,480
♪ Why so nervous? ♪

606
00:34:40,139 --> 00:34:43,270
♪ Please don't stay frozen for too long ♪

607
00:34:44,100 --> 00:34:45,909
♪ Say my name ♪

608
00:34:45,190 --> 00:34:46,070
I'd rather

609
00:34:47,340 --> 00:34:49,469
♪ Please don't stop ♪

610
00:34:47,710 --> 00:34:49,000
I had never met her.

611
00:34:49,489 --> 00:34:53,900
♪ Forgive me, I've loved you for ages ♪

612
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:58,090
♪ Please lull me into absolute surrender ♪

613
00:34:58,190 --> 00:35:01,110
♪ Before you cage me
in a prison of your design ♪

614
00:35:01,810 --> 00:35:06,150
♪ Stop bowing to the crowd ♪

615
00:35:07,870 --> 00:35:11,010
♪ Conquer to be free ♪

616
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:14,980
♪ Even if I'm unrepentantly obsessed ♪

617
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:14,630
Right.

618
00:35:15,040 --> 00:35:17,000
♪ I'll let the wrongs just carry on ♪

619
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,060
Missing out on certain people

620
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:23,300
♪ Drunk and unawakened,
waves rage stronger ♪

621
00:35:21,710 --> 00:35:23,400
may be a blessing in disguise.

622
00:35:24,680 --> 00:35:27,730
♪ Let them rage, let them rise ♪

623
00:35:27,860 --> 00:35:30,730
♪ Drench me through ♪

624
00:35:31,970 --> 00:35:36,250
♪ Come with me if you're brave ♪

625
00:35:37,590 --> 00:35:38,320
I'm sorry.

626
00:35:39,150 --> 00:35:40,000
I've

627
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:41,320
overshared.

628
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:43,450
Goodbye.

629
00:35:52,740 --> 00:35:54,960
♪ Again and again, knowing the danger ♪

630
00:35:55,830 --> 00:35:57,990
♪ Again and again, testing the limits ♪

631
00:36:03,300 --> 00:36:07,750
♪ Forgive me, I've loved you for ages ♪

632
00:36:09,310 --> 00:36:11,920
♪ Please lull me into absolute surrender ♪

633
00:36:12,030 --> 00:36:15,100
♪ Before you cage me
in a prison of your design ♪
